OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks in jeopardy as EU
OL,4,Aformally rejects latest draft after
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FShould countries be unable to reach
OL,8,Fconsensus, the negotiations could be
OL,9,Fsuspended until next year, which has
OL,10,Fhappened only once before at a COP
OL,11,Fsummit
